          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#00FFFF] animate-pulse"></span>
          <span>Guides &amp; Technical Articles</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.15]">
          Astrophotography RAW<br />
          <span class="text-[#00FFFF]">Workflow &amp; Culling Guides</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
          Practical, zero-fluff walkthroughs for sorting RAW frames, spotting cloud dips on 2D scatter plots, and feeding pristine calibration data into Siril, DeepSkyStacker, and PixInsight.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Guides Cards Grid -->
      <section class="space-y-6 mb-20">
