                  </span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-neutral-400 text-[11px] font-sans mb-4">
                  In active development for Apple Silicon (M1–M4) and Intel Macs.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <a
                  href="mailto:sprungerashton@gmail.com?subject=AstroPlot%20RAW%20macOS%20Waitlist&body=Hi%20Ashton,%20please%20notify%20me%20when%20the%20macOS%20version%20of%20AstroPlot%20RAW%20is%20ready!"
                  class="w-full text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2.5 font-semibold text-neutral-300 no-underline hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white transition-all mb-2 macos-waitlist-trigger cursor-pointer"
